<title>USA: Foodarama Supermarkets Q3 shr down at $0.25.</title>
<headline>Foodarama Supermarkets Q3 shr down at $0.25.</headline>
<dateline>FREEHOLD, N.J. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.25   profit	 $0.45</p>
<p> Net profit		   320   profit	   545</p>
<p> Sales		    147,793		  147,145</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,118,150		1,118,150</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.97     loss	 $0.85</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,190     loss	   845</p>
<p> Sales		    434,911		  447,391</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,118,150		1,118,150</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Foodarama Supermarkets Inc.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 sales figure includes new locations in Marlboro and Montgomery, New Jersey, which opened in June and July.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 sales figure includes two Pennsylvania stores sold in May 1995.</p>
<p>1995 nine-month net income and per share figures include extraordinary charge of $1,368,000 or $1.22 per share and change of accounting charge of $175,000 or $0.16 per share.</p>
</text>
